      <title>Section 14 - Derivatives of Vector-Valued Functions</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Find the derivative of a vector-valued function.</li>
    <li>Use linear properties of derivatives of vector-valued functions.</li>
    <li>
      Use dot product, cross product, and chain rule properties of derivatives of vector-valued functions.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

